WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:15.015
Are we alone in the Universe?

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:18.351
With more than 100 billion galaxies

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:19.953
in the observable universe

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:22.322
and at least 500 billion planets

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:24.290
in the Milky Way alone,

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.658
don't you think we should have

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:27.160
found something by now?  

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:30.230
Even if a tiny percentage

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.731
of those billions of planets

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:33.433
hosted intelligent life,

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:35.068
there would be tens of thousands

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:37.904
of extraterrestrial civilizations out there. 

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:40.306
Yet, we haven't seen any. 

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:46.346
We keep wondering what's
taking them so long to come.

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:47.714
But what if I told you

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:50.450
that even the friendliest of all aliens

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:52.886
could wipe out our entire civilization

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.821
for good?

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:56.456
This is WHAT IF,

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:57.757
and here's what would happen

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:00.160
if aliens visited us tomorrow.

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:08.234
We tend to apply our theories
to the rest of the Universe.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.603
We expect aliens to come for a visit,

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:11.838
even though we ourselves

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:14.307
haven't traveled out of our
own neighborhood yet.

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.142
We just believe that they've had

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:18.745
so much more time for
technological progress

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:20.447
to make space travel possible.

00:01:20.447 --> 00:01:22.015
So here they are,

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:23.983
with their shiny, alien spaceship

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:25.785
roving above our heads.

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:31.658
As far as we know,

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:35.361
no government on this planet has
any sort of  'alien greeting party'

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:39.065
planned if aliens suddenly
showed up on the horizon.

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:41.835
Just try to keep cool.

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:44.237
Say, the aliens happened to be very polite

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:48.675
and sent us a signal before
invading our planet's personal space.

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:50.944
You wouldn't know it right away.

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:54.447
Not until several observatories,
maintained by different organizations,

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:56.616
verified that signal.

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.218
Yep, that's it.

00:01:58.218 --> 00:01:59.285
Aliens are here.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:00.653
Now you know.

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:03.656
You got this shocking news from your TV.

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:05.191
"NASA officially confirmed..."

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:07.260
"...alien ship detected in the Solar System..."

00:02:12.699 --> 00:02:16.269
Agencies and countries around the
world would be working together,

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:19.038
quickly trying to assess the level of threat.

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:21.207
They'd summon experts in linguistics,

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:24.410
psychology, combat and biology,

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.614
and have them attempt to make
first contact with the aliens.

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:31.651
Groups of experts would
record all interactions

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:35.889
to analyze simple alien gestures
and auditory reactions.

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:37.490
Those would help to decide

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.325
whether aliens came in peace

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:42.095
or they intend to do some serious damage.

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:48.635
Some people might believe that

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:51.404
religious leaders should do all the talking.

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:55.241
Something is telling me aliens didn't
learn our languages in school, so...

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:57.610
good luck to anyone trying
to reach out to them.

00:02:59.279 --> 00:03:01.314
While the world's most intelligent people

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:03.650
were busy trying to interpret
the aliens' intentions

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.518
to the best of their ability,

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:06.653
you would be...

00:03:06.653 --> 00:03:07.554
Wait.

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:10.223
Aren't you curious to know
what the aliens look like?

00:03:11.658 --> 00:03:13.526
Some evolution experts agree that

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:15.495
things like proteins and DNA

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:18.398
are the same no matter where
in the Universe you're from.

00:03:18.398 --> 00:03:22.902
If that's true, alien evolution would
be close to that of humans.

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:27.140
They'd have binocular vision with
eyes located close to the brain.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:29.375
Just like us, they’d be based on land

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:31.411
and have a minimum of two legs for mobility

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:35.448
and three fingers so that
they could handle tools.

00:03:35.448 --> 00:03:39.085
Still, if some of our own
life forms look like this,

00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:42.555
try to picture something
coming from another planet.

00:03:45.124 --> 00:03:46.559
Meanwhile, on Earth,

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:49.462
while governments were busy
figuring out the action plan,

00:03:49.462 --> 00:03:51.831
the media would be keeping you informed.

00:03:55.535 --> 00:04:00.006
You'd be advised to stay indoors,
and wait for further instructions.

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:03.576
It'd be hard to filter out what's
legitimate news and what isn’t.

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:06.946
But try not to fall for fake
end-of-the-world news on Facebook

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:08.715
and keep calm...

00:04:08.715 --> 00:04:10.717
At least make an effort to give up the urge

00:04:10.717 --> 00:04:13.453
to pack up your belongings
and head for the hills.

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:15.655
At the same time,

00:04:15.655 --> 00:04:17.590
the governments and scientific experts

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:21.294
would be sharing information
about alien interactions.

00:04:21.294 --> 00:04:25.064
From here, the events could
unfold in a few different ways.

00:04:25.064 --> 00:04:29.302
First, we might not get any
auditory or visual response.

00:04:29.302 --> 00:04:30.603
Nothing at all.

00:04:31.437 --> 00:04:33.339
This could mean anything from:

00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:36.676
the alien spacecraft doesn't
have any aliens on board;

00:04:36.676 --> 00:04:41.047
to the aliens are waiting for their
alien backup to fry us up.

00:04:46.319 --> 00:04:48.087
Another possibility is that

00:04:48.087 --> 00:04:50.423
aliens responded and tried to communicate

00:04:50.423 --> 00:04:52.458
with no weapons involved.

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:54.861
I can't speak for their possible intentions.

00:04:54.861 --> 00:04:57.397
For all we know, they
may want to get rid of us

00:04:57.397 --> 00:04:59.866
and keep the Earth to themselves.

00:04:59.866 --> 00:05:04.070
Thanks to the language barrier, our
interactions might not be going well.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.239
Tensions would begin to rise.

00:05:06.239 --> 00:05:07.340
We'd be screwed.

00:05:08.908 --> 00:05:12.945
Considering that these beings
had the technology to travel to Earth,

00:05:12.945 --> 00:05:15.615
it's likely they also had the capability

00:05:15.615 --> 00:05:18.584
to develop some very,
very advanced weaponry.

00:05:21.154 --> 00:05:23.790
Civilians would most likely
be hitting the panic button

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.091
as hard as possible.

00:05:28.828 --> 00:05:32.932
Meanwhile, governments would put
their nuclear weapons on standby.

00:05:32.932 --> 00:05:38.071
That would be our our best and most
destructive weapon against them.

00:05:38.071 --> 00:05:40.273
Or so we think...

00:05:40.273 --> 00:05:43.142
It may turn out that the aliens
have adverse reactions

00:05:43.142 --> 00:05:45.912
to things on Earth that
we are all accustomed to.

00:05:46.913 --> 00:05:50.917
If, say, their skin melted
upon contact with water,

00:05:50.917 --> 00:05:53.486
then defending ourselves
against them would be simple.

00:05:55.054 --> 00:05:59.292
I'm not saying aliens would
necessarily bring doom upon the Earth.

00:05:59.292 --> 00:06:01.327
They might not mean us any harm at all.

00:06:02.095 --> 00:06:03.029
But...

00:06:03.029 --> 00:06:07.333
If some hazardous microorganisms from
outer space hitched a ride with them

00:06:07.333 --> 00:06:09.068
and made it into our world,

00:06:09.068 --> 00:06:11.104
we humans might have no natural immunity

00:06:11.104 --> 00:06:13.906
to those extraterrestrial microbes.

00:06:13.906 --> 00:06:17.977
And they could slowly wipe
our species off the planet.

00:06:17.977 --> 00:06:21.581
On the other hand, if aliens weren't
coming here to make friends,

00:06:21.581 --> 00:06:24.417
we'd be destroyed long before
we got a chance to offer

00:06:24.417 --> 00:06:26.452
peace between intelligent beings.

00:06:30.923 --> 00:06:35.595
In any case, we aren't ready for
a visit from interplanetary travelers.

00:06:35.595 --> 00:06:39.332
We better get prepared for 'first contact.'

00:06:39.332 --> 00:06:43.970
Or maybe, we should try to invade
alien worlds before they invade us.

00:06:46.305 --> 00:06:50.309
But that's a topic for another WHAT IF.

